      en: ["Formerly known as Puerto Iradier.", "Located on the Muni River estuary.", "Renowned for its Spanish colonial architecture.", "Named after the explorer Manuel Iradier.", "Situated directly opposite the border with Gabon.", "A significant center for the Ndowe culture."],
