      en: ["Located in the heart of the Centro Sur province.", "Surrounded by the foothills of the Monte Alén National Park.", "A key location for harvesting wild honey and medicinal plants.", "Situated at an elevation of about 480 meters.", "Local architecture traditionally utilizes mud and palm fronds.", "Features fertile volcanic soils in the surrounding valleys."],
