      en: ["Nkumekien is centrally located in the Centro Sur province of Río Muni.", "The settlement is surrounded by dense equatorial rainforest.", "The population belongs predominantly to the Fang ethnic group.", "Primary crops include cassava, plantains, and small amounts of cocoa.", "The region is characterized by a humid, tropical climate.", "Access is provided via unpaved or partially paved rural roads."],
